Build Employee Overview Dashboard and Task Analytics


1. Introduction

   As part of the Employee Detail Analytics Workspace, the Employee Overview Dashboard was developed to provide a comprehensive summary of an employee's work activities. This implementation focuses on presenting key task metrics and assigned task information in a structured and visually organized manner, allowing managers and administrators to quickly assess an employee's workload and progress.

   The overview dashboard serves as the primary landing page within the employee workspace, offering immediate visibility into task performance and project involvement.

2. Objective

   The objective of this implementation was to design a centralized overview page that displays employee task statistics and assigned task information, enabling users to monitor work progress without navigating through multiple screens.

3. Employee Task Summary

   A summary section was implemented to display important task-related metrics for each employee.

   Displayed Metrics
   Total Tasks
   Pending Tasks
   Active Tasks
   Completed Tasks
   Overdue Tasks
   Outcome

   Provides a quick snapshot of the employee's current workload and overall task progress.

4. Task Analytics Cards

   Interactive analytics cards were introduced to present employee task information in a visually structured format.

   Implemented
   Responsive summary cards
   Consistent color coding
   Professional card layout
   Task count visualization
   Responsive alignment
   Outcome

   Users can quickly understand employee task distribution at a glance.

5. Assigned Tasks Section

   A dedicated section was developed to display all tasks assigned to the employee.

   Displayed Information
   Task Name
   Project Name
   Current Stage
   Due Date
   Task Duration
   Task Status
   Outcome

   Provides detailed visibility into employee task assignments and progress.

6. Task Status Indicators

   Task status badges were introduced to improve readability and identify task progress quickly.

   Supported Statuses
